  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ashok Shukla vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
    "facts": "The present petition under Section 482 of Cr.P.C. has been preferred by the petitioners for quashment of the FIR registered in Crime No.174/2018 at Police Station Dimni, District Morena for the offences under Sections 55, 56, 57, 59, 60 & 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. It is the submissions of the petitioners that without resorting to the proceeding of provisions of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, respondents have caused arbitrariness and illegality in registering the case against the petitioner.",
